Description: Clipboard history that never forgets
 Funes is a fast, keyboard-first clipboard manager for X11 desktops, built
 with Python, GTK 3 and libxapp.
 .
 It keeps a searchable history of everything you copy, supports pinned items,
 and pastes the selected entry back into the window you were working in.
 History is stored locally in SQLite and entries flagged as passwords are
 never kept.
